# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored.

# Bearer token for the eMachine data-model API (without the "Bearer " prefix).
VITE_API_TOKEN=

# Where the browser sends queries. The default goes through the Vite dev/preview
# proxy (see vite.config.ts), which avoids CORS. In production, point this at
# https://emachine.instantar.io/datamodel/api/model_query if that host allows
# your origin, or at your own reverse proxy.
VITE_API_URL=/datamodel/api/model_query

# Optional: a query returning the issues a tag can be linked to (the Issues tab).
# Without it, issues are typed in by hand.
# VITE_ISSUES_QUERY=select * from issues
